<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>While Abraham remained standing before Jehovah,</l><l>His purpose was to intercede for Lot, for Lot.</l><l>This glorious intercession that Abraham made</l><l>Was just a human conversation.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Not a stranger you talk to in the grocery store once,</l><l>Not a relative you call twice a month;</l><l>This human relationship between God and man</l><l>Comes from many interactions.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
